  "title_zh": "巴西总统首席特别顾问阿莫林将访华",
  "title_en": "Brazilian President's Chief Special Advisor Amorim to Visit China",
  "summary_zh": "外交部发言人9月15日宣布，巴西总统首席特别顾问阿莫林将于9月16日至17日访华，中共中央政治局委员、中央外事工作委员会办公室主任王毅将同其举行会见。",
  "summary_en": "China's Foreign Ministry announced on September 15 that Brazilian President's Chief Special Advisor Amorim will visit China from September 16 to 17 and will meet with Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Director of the Office of the Central Commission for Foreign Affairs.",
